    },
    {
      "id": "rp_seq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1751.9735639713476,
      "y": 229.64387236485936,
      "width": 391.5,
      "height": 1080,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e2e8f0",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 15852,
      "version": 60,
      "versionNonce": 650919358,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1777715863868,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "─── COPILOT QUERY SEQUENCE ───────────────────\n\n① User types: \"How did NVDA gross margin trend?\"\n\n② Browser POST /api/v1/copilot/stream\n   with JWT Bearer token in header\n\n③ Nginx → FastAPI :8000\n   JWT middleware verifies + extracts user_id\n\n④ Redis LPOP conversation history (last 10 turns)\n\n⑤ CopilotRouter invokes Claude Haiku 4.5\n   → intent = \"stock_analysis\", ticker = \"NVDA\"\n\n⑥ LangGraph supervisor_node\n   → active_agents = [\"research\", \"earnings\"]\n\n⑦ parallel_dispatch: asyncio.gather([...])\n\n   ┌── Research Agent ──────────────────────┐\n   │ • Finnhub: real-time quote + news      │\n   │ • FMP: fundamentals, gross margin hist │\n   │ • HyDE: Claude generates fake answer   │\n   │   → embed hypothetical doc (Titan v2)  │\n   │ • Qdrant dense HNSW search (top-40)    │\n   │ • Qdrant BM42 sparse search (top-40)   │\n   │ • Hybrid RRF score fusion              │\n   │ • Cohere rerank-v3-5 → top-10          │\n   │ • Fetch parent sections from Qdrant    │\n   └────────────────────────────────────────┘\n   ┌── Earnings Agent ──────────────────────┐\n   │ • FMP: EPS history, guidance, beats    │\n   │ • EDGAR: 10-Q earnings section chunks  │\n   └────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n⑧ merge_node: dedup by citation_label\n   sort descending by relevance score\n\n⑨ context_builder: token-budget 3000 tok\n   history + live_data + chunks → system prompt\n\n⑩ Claude Sonnet 4.6 (Bedrock) streaming\n   → AsyncIterator of token chunks\n\n⑪ SSE endpoint yields: data: {\"token\": \"...\"}\n   Browser EventSource receives each chunk\n\n⑫ Frontend renders streaming text\n   + citation cards (ticker · section · year)\n   + stock panel (RSI · P/E · technicals)\n\n⑬ Redis RPUSH: save conversation turn (TTL 24h)\n\n─── LATENCY BUDGET ───────────────────────────\n  JWT verify:       < 1 ms  (in-memory)\n  Redis load:       ~1 ms   (hot path)\n  Intent route:     ~200 ms (Haiku)\n  RAG retrieval:    ~400 ms (Qdrant hybrid)\n  Cohere rerank:    ~100 ms\n  LLM first token:  ~800 ms (Bedrock)\n  Full stream:      2 – 6 s (4096 tokens)\n\n─── AUTH SEQUENCE ─────────────────────────────\n  OTP:      POST /auth/request-otp\n            → Brevo sends 6-digit code\n            → Redis SET otp:{email} TTL 10min\n            POST /auth/verify-otp\n            → Redis GET + HMAC verify\n            → PostgreSQL upsert user\n            → return JWT (30min) + refresh\n\n  Google:   OAuth2 redirect → code exchange\n            → Google id_token verify\n            → PostgreSQL upsert (google_id)\n            → return JWT\n\n  Passkey:  POST /passkey/authenticate/begin\n            → challenge (PostgreSQL)\n            POST /passkey/authenticate/complete\n            → FIDO2 verify (WebAuthn lib)\n            → return JWT\n\n─── INGESTION PIPELINE (offline Celery) ───────\n  POST /copilot/ingest (admin-only)\n  → Celery task enqueue\n  → EDGAR: CIK lookup → filing URL list\n  → rate-limited fetch (10 req/s EDGAR limit)\n  → lxml HTML parse → section extractor\n  → Chunker: 512 tok / 128 overlap\n    (sentence-transformers LAZY import\n     avoids PyTorch at gunicorn startup)\n  → Titan v2 embed → 1536-dim vectors\n  → Qdrant batch upsert (100 points/call)\n    payload: ticker · filing_type · section\n             fiscal_year · filed_date · text",
      "fontSize": 9,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "─── COPILOT QUERY SEQUENCE ───────────────────\n\n① User types: \"How did NVDA gross margin trend?\"\n\n② Browser POST /api/v1/copilot/stream\n   with JWT Bearer token in header\n\n③ Nginx → FastAPI :8000\n   JWT middleware verifies + extracts user_id\n\n④ Redis LPOP conversation history (last 10 turns)\n\n⑤ CopilotRouter invokes Claude Haiku 4.5\n   → intent = \"stock_analysis\", ticker = \"NVDA\"\n\n⑥ LangGraph supervisor_node\n   → active_agents = [\"research\", \"earnings\"]\n\n⑦ parallel_dispatch: asyncio.gather([...])\n\n   ┌── Research Agent ──────────────────────┐\n   │ • Finnhub: real-time quote + news      │\n   │ • FMP: fundamentals, gross margin hist │\n   │ • HyDE: Claude generates fake answer   │\n   │   → embed hypothetical doc (Titan v2)  │\n   │ • Qdrant dense HNSW search (top-40)    │\n   │ • Qdrant BM42 sparse search (top-40)   │\n   │ • Hybrid RRF score fusion              │\n   │ • Cohere rerank-v3-5 → top-10          │\n   │ • Fetch parent sections from Qdrant    │\n   └────────────────────────────────────────┘\n   ┌── Earnings Agent ──────────────────────┐\n   │ • FMP: EPS history, guidance, beats    │\n   │ • EDGAR: 10-Q earnings section chunks  │\n   └────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n⑧ merge_node: dedup by citation_label\n   sort descending by relevance score\n\n⑨ context_builder: token-budget 3000 tok\n   history + live_data + chunks → system prompt\n\n⑩ Claude Sonnet 4.6 (Bedrock) streaming\n   → AsyncIterator of token chunks\n\n⑪ SSE endpoint yields: data: {\"token\": \"...\"}\n   Browser EventSource receives each chunk\n\n⑫ Frontend renders streaming text\n   + citation cards (ticker · section · year)\n   + stock panel (RSI · P/E · technicals)\n\n⑬ Redis RPUSH: save conversation turn (TTL 24h)\n\n─── LATENCY BUDGET ───────────────────────────\n  JWT verify:       < 1 ms  (in-memory)\n  Redis load:       ~1 ms   (hot path)\n  Intent route:     ~200 ms (Haiku)\n  RAG retrieval:    ~400 ms (Qdrant hybrid)\n  Cohere rerank:    ~100 ms\n  LLM first token:  ~800 ms (Bedrock)\n  Full stream:      2 – 6 s (4096 tokens)\n\n─── AUTH SEQUENCE ─────────────────────────────\n  OTP:      POST /auth/request-otp\n            → Brevo sends 6-digit code\n            → Redis SET otp:{email} TTL 10min\n            POST /auth/verify-otp\n            → Redis GET + HMAC verify\n            → PostgreSQL upsert user\n            → return JWT (30min) + refresh\n\n  Google:   OAuth2 redirect → code exchange\n            → Google id_token verify\n            → PostgreSQL upsert (google_id)\n            → return JWT\n\n  Passkey:  POST /passkey/authenticate/begin\n            → challenge (PostgreSQL)\n            POST /passkey/authenticate/complete\n            → FIDO2 verify (WebAuthn lib)\n            → return JWT\n\n─── INGESTION PIPELINE (offline Celery) ───────\n  POST /copilot/ingest (admin-only)\n  → Celery task enqueue\n  → EDGAR: CIK lookup → filing URL list\n  → rate-limited fetch (10 req/s EDGAR limit)\n  → lxml HTML parse → section extractor\n  → Chunker: 512 tok / 128 overlap\n    (sentence-transformers LAZY import\n     avoids PyTorch at gunicorn startup)\n  → Titan v2 embed → 1536-dim vectors\n  → Qdrant batch upsert (100 points/call)\n    payload: ticker · filing_type · section\n             fiscal_year · filed_date · text",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b1r",
      "autoResize": true
    },
